(7492539, 1193172, 181814, '<td valign="top">Very nice looking photograph, it is very well composed and I like the color toning, the eye also looks good.</td>', 'Very nice looking photograph, it is very well composed and I like the color toning, the eye also looks good.', '2017-01-16 20:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7492540, 1193020, 181814, '<td valign="top">Great focus on the  eye, I also like the composition and the theme of hide and seek.</td>', 'Great focus on the  eye, I also like the composition and the theme of hide and seek.', '2017-01-16 20:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7492541, 1193390, 181814, '<td valign="top">Eight looking eyes, I also like the facial expression.</td>', 'Eight looking eyes, I also like the facial expression.', '2017-01-16 20:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7492584, 1193399, 150202, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, the brightness on the left side of the frame throws me off a little bit. I like the concept though.</td>', 'Nice photo, the brightness on the left side of the frame throws me off a little bit. I like the concept though.', '2017-01-17 04:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7492632, 1193396, 24744, '<td valign="top">Impactful subject, but would have been better without the bit of motion blur, and with less centred composition.  Sharpening halos are especially visible around the left edge of the bird''s plumage, too.</td>', 'Impactful subject, but would have been better without the bit of motion blur, and with less centred composition.  Sharpening halos are especially visible around the left edge of the bird''s plumage, too.', '2017-01-17 14:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7492637, 1193340, 24744, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and concept, there''s just a bit of an abrupt edge around the left where the skin tone doesn''t smoothly fade into the background which could be smoothed out a little more, and a bit of distracting noise in the pupil.</td>', 'Nice tones and concept, there''s just a bit of an abrupt edge around the left where the skin tone doesn''t smoothly fade into the background which could be smoothed out a little more, and a bit of distracting noise in the pupil.', '2017-01-17 14:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7492640, 1193420, 24744, '<td valign="top">The sharp lines on your selective saturation jar somewhat with the otherwise grainy soft texture of the image.</td>', 'The sharp lines on your selective saturation jar somewhat with the otherwise grainy soft texture of the image.', '2017-01-17 14:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7492641, 1193410, 24744, '<td valign="top">Strong concept and lighting.  Can''t help but feel a little more sharpness in the foreground fur would have improved this a little, but still an excellent image.</td>', 'Strong concept and lighting.  Can''t help but feel a little more sharpness in the foreground fur would have improved this a little, but still an excellent image.', '2017-01-17 14:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7492642, 1193009, 24744, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and an interesting composition.  Just a little too much motion blur / camera shake to keep the critical portion of the image sharp.</td>', 'Nice tones and an interesting composition.  Just a little too much motion blur / camera shake to keep the critical portion of the image sharp.', '2017-01-17 14:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7492643, 1193021, 24744, '<td valign="top">I was going to say this is ironically named because most of your image is out of "focus", but on closer examination it seems that it''s motion blur responsible for most of the loss in critical sharpness.  Still, a nice composition and concept.</td>', 'I was going to say this is ironically named because most of your image is out of "focus", but on closer examination it seems that it''s motion blur responsible for most of the loss in critical sharpness.  Still, a nice composition and concept.', '2017-01-17 14:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
